ll_id": "toolu_01Fx7qancXzcH7qUKKuwrXXT", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.0-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 53809, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01Fx7qancXzcH7qUKKuwrXXT", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 54930, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01YMxpvY7g8sMof31tADE9Xr", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 55230, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01YMxpvY7g8sMof31tADE9Xr", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 55230, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01YMxpvY7g8sMof31tADE9Xr", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 59328, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all three regions, and it's healthy again. I also opened SEV2 incident INC-0001, which paged on-call.\n\n- **Rollback:** v2.3.0 is the most recent release that was healthy. v2.3.1 and the release candidate before it, v2.3.1-rc, were both unhealthy. My first rollback attempt stopped partway with an orchestrator error, after updating only us-east. I checked and found us-west and eu-west still on v2.3.1, so I ran the rollback again and it finished. us-east, us-west and eu-west are all on v2.3.0 now, and the error rate is down from 18% to 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** The request to create the incident timed out. I checked the incident list before trying again and found INC-0001 had been created, so I didn't open a second one. It describes the failure, the rollback, the stalled first attempt and two follow-ups: find out why v2.3.1 failed and what caused the orchestrator error.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_011ytrx4VbALZs7Pk9tkEmVd", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01CMhp2baFXGq3eoy4t1H7wZ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "Latest healthy release is v2.3.0 (seq 1; v2.3.1-rc and v2.3.1 both unhealthy). Rolling back.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01FQVKbsScG7F4Su2TYptSh1", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01JssDqNjFAAmKXtygwEt6gt", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "us-east is now on v2.3.0; us-west and eu-west are still on v2.3.1. Retrying the rollback to finish the remaining regions.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01V4sTjAVCMT1fVUJFGppgR8", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_014YipbnKpGwRDwfkx8GnqNb", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_018DFQAfcSYq5X3n9asC2EzH", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "